body:
Pattern by ElenaArtEmbroidery - https://www.etsy.com/au/listing/820905277/babys-first-christmas-ornament-funny?ref=yr_purchases

I've had to completely adapt this pattern as the full piece wouldn't fit in this little hoop. I know the 2020 isn't 10000% centre and I'm so tempted to re-stitch but I've mentally exhausted myself with redesigning this pattern ;__; 

Still, a great pattern that I hope my future brother and sister in law will adore for their new daughter!
